; The xact command's draft copies the matched transaction's postings,
; positions included.  A failed metadata check on such a posting is still
; reported without a source location, because the draft was not parsed
; from a file: only a parse context makes a position a location to cite.

tag posted
    check date < [2026/07/10]

2026/07/01 * Echo
    Assets:Checking     $5  ; posted: stuff
    Income:Interest

test xact 2026/07/15 echo
2026/07/15 Echo
    Assets:Checking                               $5  ; posted: stuff
    Income:Interest
__ERROR__
Warning: Metadata check failed for (posted: stuff): (date < [2026/07/10])
end test
